                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The bottom of the sea, seen as a grave for sailors and the resting-place of anything that goes overboard and is lost."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce50532c-cfd9-4f88-96ef-76f501f44e13",
                                                "sense_id": "1305e5b7-b8b4-344b-a9c9-95304e3f3713",
                                                "text": "\"Damn my eyes,\" says he, \"they are gone to Davy Jones's locker.\"\nNOTE: Partridge erroneously refers to this as from the journal of Richard rather than Nicholas Cresswell."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50bccd00-dfeb-4587-8061-e3f445b1c7fe",
